^Under CentralPackageTransitivePinningEnabled such a pin holds the package at its version wherever it comes in through another one, and Dependabot doesn't raise it when it bumps that one, so restore fails with NU1109\. Delete each pin above\. To keep one on purpose \(a security fix, or a package an SDK references itself\), put a comment right before it: <!-- Transitive pin: <the reason> -->\.$
^Each file or folder that can't be checked must be readable for the check to pass: a regular file \(not a symlink\) of at most 4194304 bytes holding well-formed XML without a DOCTYPE, nested at most 256 deep, in an encoding (Python|\.NET) decodes; or a folder that isn't a symlink and can be listed\.$
